    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "435f86a08cddbcb1",
      "translationZh": "通过潜在因子分解实现低于 1 比特的大语言模型压缩",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4e94e99602e94efe",
      "translationZh": "LittleBit（NeurIPS 2025）和 LittleBit-2（ICML 2026）的官方实现。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "35c964194f5cacca",
      "translationZh": "LittleBit-2：通过潜在几何对齐，最大化低于 1 比特大语言模型中的谱能量增益（ICML 2026）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8fb0d9231e806951",
      "translationZh": "LittleBit：通过潜在因子分解实现超低比特量化（NeurIPS 2025）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "eaf8b6052c70993f",
      "translationZh": "LittleBit 将每个稠密权重矩阵分解为低秩潜在因子，对这些因子进行二值化，并通过轻量级的可学习缩放系数恢复幅值信息，从而将大语言模型压缩到低于 1 比特的范围。这使得极致压缩成为可能，包括每个权重 0.1 比特的配置，同时在推理时保留原始模型架构。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "498ca58106c695f5",
      "translationZh": "LittleBit-2 通过在初始化阶段解决潜在空间的几何结构错位问题，改进了这一方案。它采用结合联合迭代量化（Joint-ITQ）的内部潜在空间旋转，在 QAT 之前将由 SVD 得到的潜在因子与二值超立方体对齐。LittleBit-2 初始化可通过显式启用选项（ --use_itq ）使用，不会带来额外的推理开销。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3d210db4faad314c",
      "translationZh": "低于 1 比特的压缩：面向每个权重 1.0 至 0.1 比特的压缩设计。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c4bf2b8ddd74bd3f",
      "translationZh": "显式启用 LittleBit-2：使用 --use_itq 启用 Joint-ITQ 初始化，以改善潜在空间的几何结构对齐。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f3afe5553c1b0be9",
      "translationZh": "推理时无变化：LittleBit-2 仅修改初始化；部署后的因子化层保持不变。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d4d2a9af0a55e72b",
      "translationZh": "对 QAT 友好：支持使用 SmoothSign 的量化感知训练，并支持可选的残差因子分解。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a4e9960d2cdaf45d",
      "translationZh": "该代码库目前支持：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "66ca76afc96303c1",
      "translationZh": "我们推荐使用 Python 3.12。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7a214b5c6e6ea2cf",
      "translationZh": "要复现论文结果，请使用 transformers 4.51.x。较新的 transformers 版本可能会改变模型的内部结构或评估行为。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "272c58b458192af1",
      "translationZh": "使用量化感知训练来训练模型。默认情况下，LittleBitLinear 使用原始的仅基于 SVD 的初始化方式。要启用 LittleBit-2 (Joint-ITQ)，请传入 --use_itq True。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "575f3ef305a62c88",
      "translationZh": "使用 DeepSpeed 进行多 GPU 训练",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9b1c18fee9b2c1ca",
      "translationZh": "评估本地检查点或托管在 Hugging Face Hub 上的模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ff7acfaf64899626",
      "translationZh": "较旧的检查点可能不包含 littlebit_config.json。在这种情况下，请显式传入量化参数：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9732c9dde5f5f9ce",
      "translationZh": "参数加载优先级：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
